  "description": "A Blazor Component library that adds a easy-to-use camera-streaming functionality, which allows you to receive the streamed data.",
  "id": "BlazorCameraStreamer",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-28T13:37:02.487Z",
